  <!-- EN: synthesis dryad -->
  <OE_Dryad_Synthesis.label>合成树精</OE_Dryad_Synthesis.label>
  <!-- EN: An insect-like caste of dryad which specializes in syntherius production. Together with its crystal growing from the body, this dryad can generate a syntherius on an ongoing basis. However, it is slow and ineffective at work or combat.\n\nIn general, dryads are mammal-like creatures that have a symbiotic relationship with the Gauranlen tree. They reproduce together with their tree, which contains a hidden dryad queen. Dryads can morph into various specialized castes. -->
  <OE_Dryad_Synthesis.description>一种类似昆虫的树精阶层，专门负责合成物质生产。结合从身体生长出的水晶，这种树精可以持续生成合成物质。然而，它在工作或战斗方面缓慢而低效。\n\n总的来说，树精是类似哺乳动物的生物，与高兰树有着共生关系。它们与包含隐藏树精女王的树木一起繁殖。树精可以转变为各种专门化阶层。</OE_Dryad_Synthesis.description>
